f"Independent all-row audit recomputes all consensuses, candidate permutations, reference transports and1344fitted endpoints;0Top1 disagreements, maximum native score error{audit['max_score_error']:.3g}. Four hash-selected raw association cases verify9full affinity matrices exactly. Eight first-step gradient reconstructions maxerror{audit['max_gradient_norm_error']:.3g}. All original final boxes/source-zero outputs/source restoration pass.",'',
